{c: Verse 1}
[G]Bade Acchee lagte hai,        Kyaa
Ye [C]Dharti ye nadi [G]ya ye rai [D]na aur,        Aur [G]tum
[G]Bade Acchee lagte hai,        Ye [C]Dharti ye nadi [G]ya ye [D]raina aur
Aur [G]tum mm mmmm,        [G]Hum tum kitane [D]paas hai
kitane [C]duur hain chaand [G]sitaare,        [G]Sach poochho to [C]maan ko jhoothe
[A]lagate hain yeh [G]saare,        [G]Magar saccche lagate hai
Ye [C]Dharti ye nadi [G]ya ye [D]raina aur,        Aur [G]tum mm mmmmmm
[G]Tum in sab ko [D]chhod ke kaise,        [C]kal subah jaa [G]ogi
[G]Mere saath [C]inhe bhi to tum,        [A]yaad bahut [D]aaogi
[G]Bade Acchee lagte hai,        Ye [C]Dharti ye nadi [G]ya ye [D]raina aur
